OL,3,GNEWSAJudge apologises to juror after
OL,4,AQuran oath 'error'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA judge has apologised to a murder
OL,7,Ftrial juror who was not given the
OL,8,Foption of swearing an oath on the
OL,9,FQuran.
OL,11,FThe woman swore an oath on the Bible on
OL,12,FMonday prior to the start of a trial at
OL,13,FNorthampton Crown Court.
OL,15,FBut Judge Rebecca Crane apologised on
OL,16,FTuesday for "our error" and gave the
OL,17,Fwoman the chance to swear an oath again
OL,18,F- this time on the Quran.
OL,20,FThe judge said she had not realised
OL,21,Fthat the woman did not want to use the
OL,22,FBible.
